OL,3,GNEWSASeabirds and sewage among UNESCO
OL,4,Astatus challenges
OL,5,
OL,6,FSewage being discharged into the sea
OL,7,Fand under-threat seabirds are among the
OL,8,Fchallenges facing the Isle of Man after
OL,9,Fa decade as a UNESCO Biosphere, a
OL,10,Freport has said.
OL,12,FThe State of the Biosphere report looks
OL,13,Fback on the 10 years since the island
OL,14,Fbecame the world's first whole-nation
OL,15,FBiosphere in 2016, in recognition of
OL,16,Fits thriving natural habitats from
OL,17,Freturning wildlife to new marine
OL,18,Freserves.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
