OL,3,GNEWSASeabirds and sewage among UNESCO
OL,4,Astatus challenges
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it warns that while some wildlife
OL,7,Fis recovering, many species and
OL,8,Fhabitats are still in long-term
OL,9,Fdecline.
OL,11,FIt comes ahead of a UNESCO decision
OL,12,Fnext summer on whether the island will
OL,13,Fkeep its status.
